  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1204.46 Tire repair",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1204.46 “Tire repair” means a process that includes expanding a hole, tear, fissure, or blemish in a tire casting by grinding or gouging, applying adhesive, and filling the hole or crevice with rubber.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
